Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.47,0:00:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}“Gemini，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.37,0:00:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}我发现心仪的人身边有其他女生的影子。该怎么办？”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}“这可真让人头疼啊，首先请尝试以下方法：
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}1. 驱魔”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}音乐：我的VOCALOID有点奇怪\N视频：Ichimaru\N演唱：Ui、Gemini、Miku
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}请赐予我怎样的罪恶之语
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}“时尚”之类的，“可爱”之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}这种台词根本不够看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.27,0:00:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}请赐予我特别的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}虽然感觉和期待的不太一样，但就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}我会把满载爱意的诅咒，诅咒加在你身上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}CANT YOU! CANT YOU! Love me, Chu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}愿尊贵的精灵保佑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.93,0:00:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}CANT YOU! CANT YOU! See me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}让恋爱的诗歌应验吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}“那么，我数到三的时候，就一起念咒语吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}1、2、3，开始。”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.35,0:01:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}Vade retro satana!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnZCOOL XiaoWei}虽然感觉和期待的不太一样，但就这样吧
